---
import DemoLayout from '../../../components/demos/DemoLayout.astro';
import Art from '../../../components/demos/Art.astro';
import LocalEnquiry from '../../../components/demos/LocalEnquiry.astro';
const services=[['General care','A clear place to start.','A general care page can explain the purpose of a visit, what information may be needed and how to ask questions before attending.',['Discuss the reason for your visit','Understand the consultation process','Ask about next steps']],['Preventive care','Make space for the everyday.','A preventive care page can introduce routine care conversations without making promises about individual outcomes.',['Explore general service information','Prepare questions for a practitioner','Arrange a suitable conversation']],['Restorative care','Understand the possibilities.','A restorative care page can explain that options depend on an individual assessment by an appropriately qualified practitioner.',['Ask about the assessment process','Discuss options with a real practitioner','Review a personalised plan if appropriate']]];
---
<DemoLayout slug="modern-dental">
  <section class="demo-hero d-shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="d-kicker">Clear information. A thoughtful welcome.</p><h1>A calmer way<br />to plan your visit.</h1><p class="d-lead">Know what to expect, find the information you need and take the next step at your own pace.</p><div class="d-actions"><a class="d-button" href="#appointment">Explore an appointment →</a><a class="d-text-button" href="#services">Browse services</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><Art name="dental-hero" alt="AI-generated concept image of a welcoming dental reception with pale oak and teal details" eager sizes="100vw" /><p class="art-caption">Fictional practice · AI-generated interior</p></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="services"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">Service information</p><h2>Start with understanding.</h2></div><p>This service explorer demonstrates an information layout. It is not medical advice or a treatment recommendation.</p></div><div class="dental-services" data-switcher><div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Explore dental service categories">{services.map(([t],i)=><button type="button" data-switch={`service-${i}`} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{t} →</button>)}</div><div>{services.map(([t,h,p,points],i)=><section data-panel={`service-${i}`} hidden={i!==0} aria-label={String(t)}><p class="d-kicker">{t}</p><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p><ul>{(points as string[]).map(point=><li>{point}</li>)}</ul><a class="d-text-button" href="#appointment">Try an appointment enquiry ↓</a></section>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="journey"><p class="d-kicker">Your first visit / Sample journey</p><h2>One clear step at a time.</h2><ol class="d-steps"><li><h3>Make an enquiry</h3><p>Ask a practice about availability and the type of appointment you need.</p></li><li><h3>Prepare for the visit</h3><p>A real practice would explain what to bring and any relevant arrangements.</p></li><li><h3>Meet & discuss</h3><p>Talk with a qualified practitioner about your questions and circumstances.</p></li><li><h3>Understand the plan</h3><p>Review any proposed care, fees and alternatives before agreeing to proceed.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell d-story"><Art name="dental-two" alt="AI-generated concept image of a bright clinical room with a teal treatment chair" /><div><p class="d-kicker">A little room to feel prepared</p><h2>Questions are<br />a good place to begin.</h2><p class="d-lead">A welcoming website can make practical information easier to find.</p><p>Accessibility, opening hours, appointment arrangements and what happens on arrival belong close to the enquiry pathway. A real practice would provide verified details for each.</p><p class="demo-note">This fictional practice does not provide care, diagnosis or advice. Do not enter health information into this demonstration.</p></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="team"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">The people / Team layout concept</p><h2>Care starts with a conversation.</h2></div><p>Role-based examples show a clear team structure without inventing clinicians or qualifications.</p></div><div class="d-grid-3 dental-team"><article><h3>Clinical team</h3><p>A real profile would introduce a practitioner with verified registration, qualifications and areas of practice.</p><span class="demo-note">Profile layout only</span></article><article><h3>Care support team</h3><p>A space to explain how support staff help prepare a welcoming and organised visit.</p><span class="demo-note">Profile layout only</span></article><article><h3>Reception team</h3><p>A friendly route for practical questions about appointments, accessibility and visiting the practice.</p><span class="demo-note">Profile layout only</span></article></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><LocalEnquiry id="appointment" title="Let’s make the next step clearer." kind="appointment enquiry" options={['General care information','Preventive care information','Restorative care information','A question about visiting']} /></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="d-faq"><p class="d-kicker">Common questions</p><h2>Before a first visit.</h2><details><summary>Can I book treatment through this website?</summary><p>No. This is a fictional website concept. The appointment controls display a local preview and do not contact a practice or reserve an appointment.</p></details><details><summary>What would I bring to a real appointment?</summary><p>Contact the actual practice for its requirements. This demo cannot provide advice for a real appointment or collect medical information.</p></details><details><summary>Where would accessibility details appear?</summary><p>A real practice could provide confirmed entry, parking, communication support and access information in the visiting section below.</p></details></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="contact-strip"><div><p class="d-kicker">Contact & access</p><h3>Useful information, close at hand.</h3><p>A real practice’s address, phone, opening hours and accessibility details would be displayed here after verification.</p></div><div><h3>This practice is a concept.</h3><p>There is no real clinic or patient service behind this demo. For a website project, use the Kaiyu Select link below.</p><a class="d-text-button" href="#appointment">Try the enquiry layout ↑</a></div></div></section>
</DemoLayout>
